#: src/features/analytics/Install.tsx
msgid "With data-consent=\"required\" the script sends nothing until your consent tool says the visitor agreed. Set Collection to “Only with consent” in the general settings too, so the server refuses events without it."
msgstr "使用 data-consent=\"required\" 时,在你的同意工具表示访客已同意之前,脚本不会发送任何内容。也请在常规设置中把“收集”设为“仅限同意”,让服务器拒绝没有同意的事件。"

#: src/features/analytics/Settings.tsx
msgid "With yuva.consent and persistent set to true, the device keeps a random id for 13 months. The visitor counts once over several days, is told apart as new or returning, fills retention and is followed across days in funnels. Never under Do Not Track or Global Privacy Control."
msgstr "当 yuva.consent 的 persistent 设为 true 时,设备会保留一个随机 ID 13 个月。访客跨多天只计一次,可区分新访客或回访访客,填充留存,并在漏斗中跨天被跟踪。在 Do Not Track 或 Global Privacy Control 下绝不会这样做。"

#: src/features/analytics/text.ts
msgid "Without consent"
msgstr "无同意"

#: src/features/analytics/Retention.tsx
msgid "Without cookies a visitor is new every day, so nobody can be followed from one day to the next. Only visitors who agree to a persistent id in your consent tool show up here."
msgstr "没有 Cookie 时,访客每天都是新的,因此无法跨天跟踪任何人。只有在你的同意工具中同意持久 ID 的访客才会显示在这里。"

#: src/features/analytics/Settings.tsx
msgid "Without cookies, for everyone"
msgstr "无 Cookie,面向所有人"

#: src/features/analytics/text.ts
msgid "Yesterday"
msgstr "昨天"

